      "title": "v0.40.11",
      "url": "https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.11",
      "published_at": "2026-10-24T00:30:13Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-10-23T23:15:08Z",
      "creators": [
        "ollama/ollama"
      ],
      "language": "en",
      "abstract_or_text": "## Speech Ollama can now generate [speech](https://docs.ollama.com/capabilities/speech) on macOS. `ollama run` plays text or a chat model's reply aloud as the audio is generated, and apps can stream audio through the OpenAI-compatible `/v1/audio/speech` endpoint. ```sh ollama run phonon \"Hello from Ollama.\" ``` ## d3 decision models [d3](https://ollama.com/library/d3) brings vLLM Semantic Router's decision models to Ollama. Give a model text, structured state, or an image, and ask it to classify…",
      "summary_zh": "ollama/ollama v0.40.11 在 macOS Apple Silicon 上加入 Phonon 语音生成，并支持通过 OpenAI 兼容的 /v1/audio/speech 接口流式输出；同时引入 2B、4B、9B 和 27B 的 d3 决策模型。",
      "why_it_matters_zh": "这是本地推理运行时从文本生成扩展到语音和决策模型的重要更新，适合隐私敏感应用、本地助手和需要统一 API 的开发者。语音能力目前聚焦 Apple Silicon，决策模型的实际延迟与质量也取决于硬件和模型规格，升级前应做端到端回归。",
      "quality_score": 66.0,
      "tags": [
        "本地模型运行时",
        "本地推理",
        "语音生成",
        "决策模型",
        "OpenAI 兼容 API",
        "多模态输入"
      ],
      "evidence_flags": [
        "github"
      ],
